Soon a group of people standing separately drew his attention. Men were abuzz like a bee hive. Ragnar approached for a closer look. He was surprised that men didn't pay attention to his appearance, because people would often step aside upon seeing Lemurian's massive, tall figure.
"I've got to find out what is going on there," thought Ragnar. He began to elbow his way through. At this moment his high, stately figure resembled a rock raising above the surface of a stormy sea.